sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Product as Mesa Tica
    Customer->>Product: Place reviewed pickup order
    alt Same submission already accepted
    Product-->>Customer: Same order number and confirmation, even after closing
    else New submission needs correction
    Product-->>Customer: No order created, retain cart and explain correction
    Customer->>Product: Review corrected choices before another explicit submission
    else Valid new submission
    Product-->>Customer: Received order, unique number, accepted contents/total, private link
    end
    opt Result uncertain because connection failed
    Product-->>Customer: Result not confirmed, recover this attempt before another order
    Customer->>Product: Check or safely retry same submission
    alt Order accepted
    Product-->>Customer: Original accepted confirmation
    else Confirmed rejection
    Product-->>Customer: Correction and retained cart, no order
    else Still unavailable
    Product-->>Customer: Remain uncertain, do not create another order
    end
    end
    opt Accepted confirmation is available
    Customer->>Product: Copy tracking link
    alt Copy succeeds
    Product-->>Customer: Copied feedback and save guidance
    else Copy unavailable
    Product-->>Customer: Selectable link and manual-copy guidance
    end
    end
